<p>
Welcome to my page. I am a Ph.D. student of <a href="https://fuw.edu.pl">Physics</a> in <a href ="https://en.uw.edu.pl">University of Warsaw</a>. My PhD thesis is about pattern formation in dissolving rocks. In my PhD, I have developed theoretical and computational models to study the physics of <a href="https://blog.rishabhps.com/mydata/disspattern.jpg">dissolution patterns</a> with particular interest in self-organization of reactive flows in dissolving medium. In addition, I have integrated the developed models with experimental data&mdash;in the form of 4D X-ray imaging&mdash;obtained from laboratory experiments to study the numerical erosion of reconstructed pore-space of a rock sample.
</p>